        {
          "text": "Kwakukhona futhi amakhosi anamandla phezu kweJerusalema, ayebusa phezu kwawo wonke amazwe aphesheya koMfula; futhi imigwaqo, izintela kanye nemigwaqo yakhokhelwa kubo.",
